OL,3,GNEWSACyber boss warns over tech
OL,4,Avulnerabilities
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of the island's cyber security
OL,7,Fcentre has questioned whether so many
OL,8,Fhousehold and commercial appliances
OL,9,Fneed to be connected to the internet.
OL,11,FIt comes after dozens of European
OL,12,Fsupermarkets were hit by cyber-attacks
OL,13,Fthat increased the temperature of
OL,14,Ffreezers to more than 50C (122F).
OL,16,FMatt Palmer, the director of the Jersey
OL,17,FCyber Security Centre, said he "wasn't
OL,18,Fsuggesting that people should unplug
OL,19,Fdevices, but that he would challenge
OL,20,Fwhether everyone needs a connected
OL,21,Ffridge".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
